  "title": "DOF: Avoid tvb_get_ptr with length -1",
  "description": "Call tvb_get_ptr with the same length that is used later on in decrypt()\nas the length of the buffer. This prevents copying unnecessarily (e.g.,\nin a composite TVB), and also guarantees that there's no memory error\nlater by accessing past that length by throwing an exception. An\nexception was probably thrown by this point if offset was past the\ncaptured data, but ensure it.",
